From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Giga Edge SDK <noreply@giga-edge-sdk.invalid>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 13:31:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/12] llama: load models through a bounded reader

llama_model_reader and llama_model_load_from_reader let the caller supply
the model bytes through callbacks; mmap and the model loader read through
them. A reader must return exactly the requested length. Async upload
buffers are freed when loading throws.

test-model-reader covers invalid readers, short reads in the header and in
the middle of a tensor, cancellation through progress_callback, logits
bitwise equal to the file load, no reads after the load, n_gpu_layers 0 and
999, and the vocab-only run.
